    "detailed_description": "The Kingdom of Light is in trouble, and only its greatest Heroes can help!<br />\r\nLenz is a kind and brave young man who fights in the name of his Kingdom! Upon finding a letter from King Nicolas at his friend Sky's house, he immediately leaves for the castle, but little did he know what awaited him there...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Live the most vibrant Adventures in this world full of surprises!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Fight for your life against the most diverse creatures.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Engaging story showing each side of the characters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Official Theme Track sung by The Kira Justice.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Use your RPG knowledge to beat your enemies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game &quot;A Hero's Legacy&quot; is an indie action-adventure RPG style game. As it is a semi-open world, the player has several places to explore. In the game, you can walk, run, jump (at certain times) and interact with the scenery and the NPCs themselves. As you play, you will learn more about the characters' stories and their mysteries.",
    "about_the_game": "The Kingdom of Light is in trouble, and only its greatest Heroes can help!<br />\r\nLenz is a kind and brave young man who fights in the name of his Kingdom! Upon finding a letter from King Nicolas at his friend Sky's house, he immediately leaves for the castle, but little did he know what awaited him there...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Live the most vibrant Adventures in this world full of surprises!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Fight for your life against the most diverse creatures.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Engaging story showing each side of the characters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Official Theme Track sung by The Kira Justice.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Use your RPG knowledge to beat your enemies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game &quot;A Hero's Legacy&quot; is an indie action-adventure RPG style game. As it is a semi-open world, the player has several places to explore. In the game, you can walk, run, jump (at certain times) and interact with the scenery and the NPCs themselves. As you play, you will learn more about the characters' stories and their mysteries.",
    "short_description": "Lenz is a kind and charismatic young man who will embark on this fantasy journey in a vast world, full of incredible adventures to explore, and several secrets to uncover!",
